I left out the `http-client` import and the enrichment call. The node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/notifier@0.1.0`, and the graph definition hasn't been updated to add `http-client`. Sending the digest text to an external host would also move data outside the node's declared authority. If the graph is updated to grant `http-client`, the enrichment can be added then.

